<title>HONG KONG: Yizheng Chemical 1996 net falls 82 pct.</title>
<headline>Yizheng Chemical 1996 net falls 82 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million yuan unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (yuan)		   0.054    vs  0.314</p>
<p>    Dividend (yuan)	    0.033    vs  0.077</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil	vs  nil</p>
<p>    Net			    215.65   vs  1,212.91</p>
<p>    Turnover		     6,999,12 vs  9,302.44</p>
<p>    Company name		 Yizheng Chemical Fibre Co Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  to be announced</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   to be announced</p>
<p>NOTE - Chinese polyester manufacturer Yizheng Chemical Fibre lists its H shares in Hong Kong. The figures are based on international accounting standards.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is 0.066 yuan (including interim dividend of 0.033 yuan) vs 0.11 yuan.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
